# Headstone Pilgrimage: Yuhtunga Jungle's headstone (Fire Fragment), five of the others held. Without its
# fragment it first plays 200 (Fire); option 0 does nothing; 3 yalms off option 1 says
# MUST_MOVE_CLOSER (7719: 0, the fragment); close by, option 1 shows THE_OPO_OPOS_ATTACK (7721, a 0x036 message)
# and spawns Tipha and Carthi. With both up, and again right after Tipha's kill, the headstone says
# SOMETHING_BETTER (7698); the trace cannot show whether the killed NM still counts as spawned there (the two
# spawn tests joined by or change no trace), so the one-up arm is pinned by a fake check.
# Each kill gives 145 XP. Once both are dead it plays 201 instead; option 0
# does nothing, 3 yalms off MUST_MOVE_CLOSER, close by option 1 adds Wrath of the Opo-opos and gives the fragment
# (KEYITEM_OBTAINED 6398). Held, with Wrath of the Opo-opos not completed, the mission answers nothing: the
# quest's TOUCHING_RED_JEWEL (7707) plays. A GM adds the last fragment and takes this one: 201's
# option 1 says FOUND_ALL_FRAGS (7704) and completes the mission (the Bearer of the Eight Prayers title,
# Through the Quicksand Caves current). Completed, the quest (still accepted) answers again with 7707;
# section 2's ZILART_MONUMENT does not show.
lists YuhtungaJungle/Cermet_Headstone/onTrigger YuhtungaJungle/onEventFinish/200 YuhtungaJungle/onEventFinish/201
char zone=YuhtungaJungle pos=491,20,301 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart HeadstonePilgrimage current
keyitem WindFragment
keyitem EarthFragment
keyitem LightningFragment
keyitem WaterFragment
keyitem LightFragment
login
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # no fragment, no NM up: 200
finish option=0                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Cermet_Headstone at=3           # 200
finish option=1                         # 3 yalms off: MUST_MOVE_CLOSER
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # 200
finish option=1                         # THE_OPO_OPOS_ATTACK, the NMs spawned
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # both up: SOMETHING_BETTER
kill TIPHA                              
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # after the kill: SOMETHING_BETTER
kill CARTHI                             # the last dead: 201 next
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # both NMs dead: 201
finish option=0                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Cermet_Headstone at=3           # 201
finish option=1                         # 3 yalms off: MUST_MOVE_CLOSER
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # 201
finish option=1                         # the quest added, the fragment
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # held, the quest not completed: its 7707
finish-if-event
keyitem IceFragment                     # a GM
delkeyitem FireFragment                 # a GM
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # 201
finish option=1                         # the last fragment: FOUND_ALL_FRAGS, completed
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # completed: the quest's 7707
finish-if-event
